{"id":"877a0a4748396497","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NConseq.md","title":"NConseq","display":"NConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NConseq","parameters":["r","g","e"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>e</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>e</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NConseq r g e)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ NMode r)\n  (and\n    (@ NEqs g)\n    (exists t\n      (exists u\n        (and\n          (@ Pair t u e)\n          (and\n            (@ NRaw t)\n            (and (@ NRaw u) (forall R (implies (and (@ NCongruence r R) (@ Subset g R)) (@ Edge R t u))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d885c3585f2c1\" href=\"?note=888d885c3585f2c1\" title=\"ZFC_NCongruence\">NCongruence</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"627569382a44bdf5\" href=\"?note=627569382a44bdf5\" title=\"ZFC_NEqs\">NEqs</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e430f284172300e\" href=\"?note=2e430f284172300e\" title=\"ZFC_NMode\">NMode</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" href=\"?note=5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" title=\"ZFC_Subset\">Subset</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NConseq r g e)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_NCongruence|NCongruence]]；[[ZFC_NEqs|NEqs]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NCongruence","status":"resolved","id":"888d885c3585f2c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_NCongruence|NCongruence]]；[[ZFC_NEqs|NEqs]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NEqs","status":"resolved","id":"627569382a44bdf5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_NCongruence|NCongruence]]；[[ZFC_NEqs|NEqs]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NMode","status":"resolved","id":"2e430f284172300e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC